240
00:36:44,480 --> 00:36:54,720
te nam poslije ovoga progona pokaže Isusa, blagoslovljeni plod u travesove, oblaga, omila, oslatka Djevice, Marijo, amen.

241
00:36:55,360 --> 00:36:59,680
